		if ( ( ( ( GetUnitTypeId(GetTriggerUnit()) == 'E07X' ) and ( ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "1" ) or ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "2" ) or ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "4" ) or ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "5" ) or ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "6" ) or ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "7" ) ) ) ) ) then
			//Boss施法结束后取消无敌
			call SetUnitInvulnerable(GetTriggerUnit(), false)
		else
		endif
		if ( ( ( ( GetUnitTypeId(GetTriggerUnit()) == 'E07X' ) and ( ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "3" ) ) ) ) ) then
			call SetUnitTimeScale(GetTriggerUnit(), 1.00)
			call SetUnitInvulnerable(GetTriggerUnit(), false)
		else
		endif
	else
	endif
	if ( ( GetUnitTypeId(GetTriggerUnit()) == 'O005' ) and ( YDWEGetUnitAbilityDataString(GetTriggerUnit() , GetSpellAbilityId() , 1 , 216) == "3" ) ) then
		call SaveUnitHandle(YDHT, GetHandleId(GetTriggerUnit()), 0x70358094, GetSpellTargetUnit())
	else
	endif
	call FlushChildHashtable(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetTriggeringTrigger()) * ydl_localvar_step)
	set ydl_timer=null
endfunction
//===========================================================================
function InitTrig_DMboss____________03 takes nothing returns nothing
	set gg_trg_DMboss____________03=CreateTrigger()
	call TriggerAddCondition(gg_trg_DMboss____________03, Condition(function Trig_DMboss____________03Conditions))
	call TriggerAddAction(gg_trg_DMboss____________03, function Trig_DMboss____________03Actions)
endfunction
//===========================================================================
// Trigger: 死亡事件SW01
//===========================================================================
function Trig_____________SW01Actions takes nothing returns nothing
	if ( ( GetUnitTypeId(GetTriggerUnit()) == 'n03S' ) ) then
		call ModifyGateBJ(bj_GATEOPERATION_OPEN, gg_dest_B00M_13602)
		call TransmissionFromUnitWithNameBJ(GetPlayersAll(), null, "？？？", null, "（远处的声音）不错，你们几个小鬼的实力得到了我的认可，进来吧！", bj_TIMETYPE_SET, 10.00, false)
	else
	endif
endfunction
//===========================================================================
function InitTrig_____________SW01 takes nothing returns nothing
	set gg_trg_____________SW01=CreateTrigger()
	call TriggerRegisterPlayerUnitEventSimple(gg_trg_____________SW01, Player(PLAYER_NEUTRAL_AGGRESSIVE), EVENT_PLAYER_UNIT_DEATH)
	call TriggerAddAction(gg_trg_____________SW01, function Trig_____________SW01Actions)
endfunction
//===========================================================================
// Trigger: 未命名触发器 002
//===========================================================================
function Trig____________________002Func001Func001Func012T takes nothing returns nothing
 local group ydl_group
 local unit ydl_unit
	if ( ( GetUnitTypeId(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0x458B7DE9)) == 'N05D' ) ) then
		call EC_CreateEffect("war3mapImported\\superdarkflash.mdl" , GetUnitX(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0xF047C7C9)) , GetUnitY(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0xF047C7C9)) , 35.00 , 270.0 , 1.10 , 1.0 , 1.10)
		set ydl_group=CreateGroup()
		call GroupEnumUnitsInRange(ydl_group, GetUnitX(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0xF047C7C9)), GetUnitY(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0xF047C7C9)), 250.00, null)
		loop
			set ydl_unit=FirstOfGroup(ydl_group)
			exitwhen ydl_unit == null
			call GroupRemoveUnit(ydl_group, ydl_unit)
			if ( ( IsUnitEnemy(ydl_unit, GetOwningPlayer(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0x458B7DE9))) == true ) and ( IsUnitType(ydl_unit, UNIT_TYPE_ANCIENT) == false ) and ( IsUnitAliveBJ(ydl_unit) == true ) ) then
				call UnitDamageTarget(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0x458B7DE9), ydl_unit, ( ( GetUnitState(LoadUnitHandle(YDLOC, GetHandleId(GetExpiredTimer()), 0x458B7DE9), ConvertUnitState(0x15)) ) * ( 1.25 ) ), false, false, ATTACK_TYPE_NORMAL, DAMAGE_TYPE_SHADOW_STRIKE, WEAPON_TYPE_WHOKNOWS)
			else
			endif
		endloop
		call DestroyGroup(ydl_group)
	else
	endif
	set ydl_group=null
	set ydl_unit=null
endfunction
